### Consultar meus dados
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN


### Atualizar meus dados
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Guilherme Rocha Atualizado",
    "email": "guilherme@teste.com"
}


### Alterar minha senha
PATCH http://localhost:8080/admin/me/senha
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "senhaAtual": "Teste@12",
    "senhaNova": "NovaSenha@123",
    "confirmarSenha": "NovaSenha@123"
}


### Listar administradores
GET http://localhost:8080/admin
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN


### Buscar administrador por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/7
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN


### Buscar administrador por e-mail
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/buscar/email?email=guilherme5@teste.com
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN


### Buscar administradores por nome
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/buscar/nome?nome=tes
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN


### Criar administrador
POST http://localhost:8080/admin
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Teste 2",
    "email": "teste2@teste.com",
    "senha": "Teste@12"
}


### Atualizar administrador (nome e e-mail)
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/11
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Teste 02",
    "email": "teste02@outroteste.com"
}


### Deletar administrador
DELETE http://localhost:8080/admin/11
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
